# Hashed 2026-10-25 (UTC) on AWS (c8g.4xlarge, us-west-2), streaming each object where it lives (aws s3 cp - | sha256sum). This was AFTER the measurement's runs: it proves today's bytes, not necessarily the bytes the run read.
# Bucket copies under inputs/bwa-real/. The same day the RODA originals under s3://1000genomes (technical/reference/GRCh38_reference_genome/, phase3/data/HG00096/sequence_read/) were hashed in place and are identical for every file below except the .fa, which was not hashed at RODA.
# Earlier hashes of the same objects agree: .alt/.amb/.ann/.bwt/.pac/.sa in bwa-mem2-real's run results (results/*/bwa/results.tsv); both read files in qc-aggregate-real/inputs.sha256 and fastp-real's run smoke checks.
